Source: pitstore
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Maintainer: PitStore Maintainers <webmaster@rcontentdesign.nl>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13)
Standards-Version: 4.6.2
Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: pitstore
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends},
         cockpit-bridge (>= 300),
         cockpit-ws (>= 300),
Recommends: podman
Suggests: docker.io
Description: app dashboard and app store for Cockpit
 PitStore adds two pages to the Cockpit web console: a dashboard with
 tiles for installed container apps, and an app store that reads catalogs
 in the CasaOS AppStore format.
 .
 Apps run on Podman (rootless by default) or optionally on Docker. All
 access goes through the Cockpit session; PitStore runs no daemon and
 opens no network port.
